{"ID":"20240206103319-oz5gfzf","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206103319-oz5gfzf","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103319-oz5gfzf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206103329-ycg4mhk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607132404-c67hbz3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620115142-lve6tvp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"085王不留行","type":"doc","updated":"20240808125550"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240808110239-eayrcbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808110239-eayrcbf","updated":"20240808112733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"北王不留行（麦蓝菜种子）"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"（药用王不留行主要指北王不留行）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240206103329-ycg4mhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103329-ycg4mhk","updated":"20240206103332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产江苏、河北、河南、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t该品呈球形，直径约2mm。表面黑色，少数红棕色，略有光泽，有细密颗粒 状突起，另有一浅色圆点状肿脐及一凹陷的纵向浅沟。质坚硬，断面灰白色，角质样。无臭，味微涩苦。\n【性味】\t苦，平。\n【功效】\t活血通经，消肿止痛，催生下乳的功能。主治月经不调，乳汁缺乏，难产，痈肿疔毒等症，是临床常用下乳的重要药。"}]},{"ID":"20240206103322-81o9v57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206103322-81o9v57","updated":"20240620114528"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103322-bh5kigi.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808110655-pf2dimy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Propert